language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

scenario DegradedOperation.
condition DegradedOperationReady.
condition DegradedOperationContinue.
condition DegradedOperationReject.
outcome DegradedOperationCompleted.
outcome DegradedOperationRejected.
step DegradedOperationDetect.
step DegradedOperationMark.
step DegradedOperationDisplay.
step DegradedOperationFailure.
step DegradedOperationSuccess.

DegradedOperation illustrates InspectMachineWithoutBucking.
DegradedOperation exercises FederatedBrowserAccess.
DegradedOperation starts-when DegradedOperationReady.
DegradedOperation starts-at DegradedOperationDetect.
DegradedOperationReady describes "Machine is available and Bucking is unavailable.".
DegradedOperationContinue describes "The previous operation succeeded and the next step's declared contract preconditions remain true; exact predicates are an executable-language gap.".
DegradedOperationReject describes "Validation, authority, applicability or operation failure prevents continuation; preserve prior valid state and report the specific reason.".
DegradedOperationCompleted describes "The stated design path completed under its explicit obligations; this is not an observed test result.".
DegradedOperationRejected describes "The path terminated without claiming the requested change succeeded; failures remain observable.".
DegradedOperation preserves ConservativeQuality.
DegradedOperation preserves DomainTruthOwned.
DegradedOperationDetect calls MaintainDualUpstreams within BuckingWeb.
DegradedOperationDetect describes "Detect independent upstream availability.".
DegradedOperationDetect proceeds-to DegradedOperationFailure when DegradedOperationReject.
DegradedOperationDetect proceeds-to DegradedOperationMark when DegradedOperationContinue.
DegradedOperationMark calls RetainDegradedBrowserState within BuckingWeb.
DegradedOperationMark describes "Mark only dependent data stale/unavailable.".
DegradedOperationMark proceeds-to DegradedOperationFailure when DegradedOperationReject.
DegradedOperationMark proceeds-to DegradedOperationDisplay when DegradedOperationContinue.
DegradedOperationDisplay calls KeepMachineViewAvailable within BuckingUI.
DegradedOperationDisplay describes "Retain Machine telemetry, health and available semantic controls.".
DegradedOperationDisplay proceeds-to DegradedOperationFailure when DegradedOperationReject.
DegradedOperationDisplay proceeds-to DegradedOperationSuccess when DegradedOperationContinue.
DegradedOperationFailure finishes DegradedOperation with DegradedOperationRejected.
DegradedOperationSuccess finishes DegradedOperation with DegradedOperationCompleted.
